# Harness runtime logs and temporary files.
**/_dbg/
.gate/
*.log
*.tmp
~$*

# Binary Excel workbooks are human-managed runtime artifacts (churn every
# harness run) — the src\ beside them is the tracked source of truth.
*.xlsb
*.xlsm
*.xlsx

# test templates
test_*/
archive/
releases/

# Shared package install artifacts (node_modules 모델): UnivCore 등 공용 패키지의
# Core_* 모듈은 deps.lock에서 hydrate되는 설치 산출물이므로 추적하지 않는다.
# deps.lock(선언/핀)은 커밋한다.
src/Core_*